# Sachet capture scratch. The archive and the manifest under data/sachet/ ARE
# committed evidence; only the staged write and the run lock are transient, and
# a SIGKILL mid-replace must not leave something `git add data/sachet/` picks up.
data/sachet/*.tmp
data/sachet/*.lock
data/sachet/.lock
